{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, fully responsive Shopify Liquid section for Kiss & Kry titled "Giving Back – Outgrown, Not Outworn."
    
    IMPORTANT: Use the uploaded reference image as the exact visual design reference. Reproduce the layout, proportions, spacing, typography, colours, card styles, image placements and overall composition as closely as possible.
    
    Do not redesign, simplify or reinterpret the layout.
    
    The section should communicate Kiss & Kry's sustainable babywear return and redistribution initiative.
    
    1. OVERALL DESIGN & COLOUR PALETTE
    
    Create a full-width premium editorial-style section.
    
    Main background:
    
    Deep muted olive green: #5E6848 (approximate).
    
    Primary text: Warm ivory #F6F2E5.
    
    Secondary text: Muted sage-beige #C7C7AD.
    
    Accent colour: Warm mustard gold #E9AC29.
    
    Light card background: #F5F0E9.
    
    Dark olive card: #495239.
    
    Borders: Subtle translucent sage/olive.
    
    Design characteristics:
    
    Luxury editorial aesthetic.
    
    Premium babywear branding.
    
    Minimal, sophisticated and spacious.
    
    Rounded corners.
    
    Subtle background decorative circular outlines.
    
    No unnecessary gradients.
    
    No excessive shadows.
    
    Avoid generic ecommerce layouts.
    
    Use Montserrat for all typography.
    
    2. SECTION ONE – HERO / GIVING BACK INTRODUCTION
    
    Create a two-column desktop layout.
    
    LEFT COLUMN – 48% WIDTH
    
    Small eyebrow heading:
    "GIVING BACK"
    
    Add a short horizontal mustard-gold line before the label.
    
    Main heading:
    
    "Outgrown,
    Not Outworn."
    
    Typography:
    
    Large, bold Montserrat.
    
    Approximately 40–44px desktop.
    
    Warm ivory colour.
    
    Tight line height.
    
    Left aligned.
    
    Description:
    
    "At Kiss & Kry, we believe true luxury goes beyond premium fabrics and adorable designs. It's compassion, community and sustainability — and it sits at the heart of our 'Giving Back' initiative."
    
    Use 14px text with comfortable line spacing.
    
    Below the description, create an editorial image composition:
    
    Large vertical image on the left showing a premium cardboard return box with Kiss & Kry branding.
    
    Smaller rectangular image on the right showing a baby garment being held or folded.
    
    Rounded corners.
    
    Subtle overlapping composition.
    
    Add small ivory pill labels:
    "Step 01 · Return"
    "Step 02 · Redistribute"
    
    Add a circular olive-and-gold seal overlapping the images, featuring a return/recycle arrow and small curved text:
    "RETURN • REWARD • REDISTRIBUTE"
    
    RIGHT COLUMN – 52% WIDTH
    
    Small eyebrow heading:
    "OUR UNIQUE INITIATIVE"
    
    Add a thin horizontal line extending towards the right.
    
    Create two vertically stacked process cards.
    
    STEP 01 – RETURN & REWARD
    
    Card styling:
    
    Background: #F5F0E9.
    
    Rounded corners: 22px.
    
    Generous internal padding.
    
    Light, premium appearance.
    
    Top section:
    
    Circular olive icon background.
    
    Minimal package/return box icon.
    
    Small label: "STEP 01"
    
    Heading: "Return & Reward"
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(38px, 6vw, 88px) clamp(22px, 5vw, 76px);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, 'Montserrat', sans-serif);
  }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before,
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    border: 1px solid rgba(199, 199, 173, .16);
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before { width: 370px; height: 370px; right: -170px; top: -210px; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}::after { width: 250px; height: 250px; left: -155px; bottom: -145px; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 1320px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: .92fr 1fr; gap: clamp(38px, 7vw, 104px); align-items: start; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin: 0 0 22px; color: {{ block.settings.muted_color }}; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .17em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow::before { content: ''; width: 30px; height: 1px; background: {{ block.settings.accent_color }}; flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title { margin: 0 0 20px; max-width: 520px; color: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; font-size: clamp(38px, 4vw, 54px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.045em; line-height: 1.02; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro { max-width: 510px; margin: 0; color: {{ block.settings.muted_color }}; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collage { position: relative; height: 350px; max-width: 525px; margin-top: 34px; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image { position: absolute; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 16px; background: rgba(246,242,229,.12); }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image--main { left: 0; top: 0; width: 61%; height: 100%; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image--small { right: 0; top: 54px; width: 47%; height: 218px; border: 5px solid {{ block.settings.background_color }}; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img, .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; object-fit: cover; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image svg { background: #ddd8cf; color: #817d70; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty { position: absolute; left: 10px; right: 10px; bottom: 10px; padding: 8px 10px; color: #fff; background: rgba(45,49,35,.78); border-radius: 8px; font-size: 11px; text-align: center; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill { position: absolute; z-index: 2; border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 13px; background: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; color: #35402a; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill--one { left: 16px; bottom: 18px; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill--two { right: 7px; bottom: 39px; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__seal { position: absolute; z-index: 3; left: 48%; top: 51%; width: 104px; height: 104px; transform: translate(-50%,-50%); display: grid; place-items: center; border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.accent_color }}; border-radius: 50%; background: {{ block.settings.dark_card_color }}; color: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; text-align: center; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__seal svg { width: 31px; height: 31px; color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }}; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__seal span { display: block; max-width: 76px; font-size: 8px; line-height: 1.4; letter-spacing: .11em; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__right .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow { justify-content: space-between; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__right .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow::after { content: ''; height: 1px; background: rgba(199,199,173,.4); flex: 1; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards { display: grid; gap: 16px; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 34px); border-radius: 22px; background: {{ block.settings.light_card_color }}; color: #30352a; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--dark { background: {{ block.settings.dark_card_color }}; color: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cardtop { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 17px; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon { width: 48px; height: 48px; flex: 0 0 48px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; background: #495239; color: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--dark .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon { background: {{ block.settings.accent_color }}; color: #343a29; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .15em; color: #70745e; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--dark .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step { color: {{ block.settings.muted_color }}; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.025em; line-height: 1.2; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card p { margin: 0; color: #565a4c; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.75; }
  .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--dark p { color: {{ block.settings.muted_color }}; }
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }} { width: 100%; padding: 42px 22px; }
    .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
    .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title { font-size: clamp(38px, 10vw, 48px); }
    .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collage { height: 300px; margin-top: 27px; }
    .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image--small { top: 38px; height: 190px; }
    .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__seal { width: 86px; height: 86px; }
    .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__seal span { font-size: 7px; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<section class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__left">
      <p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.left_eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      <h2 class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{{ block.settings.heading | escape | newline_to_br }}</h2>
      <div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro">{{ block.settings.intro }}</div>
      <div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collage" aria-label="Return and redistribution process">
        <div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image--main">
          {% if block.settings.return_image != blank %}<img src="{{ block.settings.return_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.return_image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ block.settings.return_image.width }}" height="{{ block.settings.return_image.height }}">{% else %}<div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-wrap">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}<span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty">Add an image of your return box</span></div>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image--small">
          {% if block.settings.garment_image != blank %}<img src="{{ block.settings.garment_image | image_url: width: 700 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.garment_image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ block.settings.garment_image.width }}" height="{{ block.settings.garment_image.height }}">{% else %}<div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-wrap">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}<span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty">Add a garment image</span></div>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill--one">Step 01 · Return</span>
        <span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill--two">Step 02 · Redistribute</span>
        <div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__seal" aria-label="Return, reward, redistribute">
          <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 7v5h-5M4 17v-5h5"/><path d="M5.6 9A7 7 0 0 1 18 6l2 6M4 12l2 6a7 7 0 0 0 12.4-3"/></svg><span>RETURN · REWARD · REDISTRIBUTE</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__right">
      <p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.right_eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      <div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards">
        <article class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card">
          <div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cardtop"><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m3 7 9-4 9 4-9 4-9-4Z"/><path d="M3 7v10l9 4 9-4V7M12 11v10"/><path d="m8 5 9 4"/></svg></span><div><p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step">STEP 01</p><h3>{{ block.settings.card_one_title | escape }}</h3></div></div>
          <p>{{ block.settings.card_one_text | escape }}</p>
        </article>
        <article class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--dark">
          <div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cardtop"><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v3m0 12v3M3 12h3m12 0h3"/><path d="M7 7l2 2m6 6 2 2m0-10-2 2m-6 6-2 2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/></svg></span><div><p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step">STEP 02</p><h3>{{ block.settings.card_two_title | escape }}</h3></div></div>
          <p>{{ block.settings.card_two_text | escape }}</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Giving back",
  "settings": [
    {"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},
    {"type":"header","content":"Introduction"},
    {"type":"text","id":"left_eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow","default":"GIVING BACK"},
    {"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"Outgrown,\nNot Outworn."},
    {"type":"richtext","id":"intro","label":"Description","default":"<p>At Kiss &amp; Kry, we believe true luxury goes beyond premium fabrics and adorable designs. It's compassion, community and sustainability — and it sits at the heart of our 'Giving Back' initiative.</p>"},
    {"type":"image_picker","id":"return_image","label":"Return box image"},
    {"type":"image_picker","id":"garment_image","label":"Garment image"},
    {"type":"header","content":"Process cards"},
    {"type":"text","id":"right_eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow","default":"OUR UNIQUE INITIATIVE"},
    {"type":"text","id":"card_one_title","label":"Step 1 title","default":"Return & Reward"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"card_one_text","label":"Step 1 description","default":"Send back your Kiss & Kry pieces once your little one has outgrown them. We’ll welcome each returned garment with a reward toward your next purchase."},
    {"type":"text","id":"card_two_title","label":"Step 2 title","default":"Redistribute with care"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"card_two_text","label":"Step 2 description","default":"Each returned piece is given a new chapter, helping quality babywear reach another family and keeping wearable clothing in use for longer."},
    {"type":"header","content":"Colours"},
    {"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#5E6848"},
    {"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Primary text","default":"#F6F2E5"},
    {"type":"color","id":"muted_color","label":"Secondary text","default":"#C7C7AD"},
    {"type":"color","id":"accent_color","label":"Accent","default":"#E9AC29"},
    {"type":"color","id":"light_card_color","label":"Light card","default":"#F5F0E9"},
    {"type":"color","id":"dark_card_color","label":"Dark card","default":"#495239"}
  ],
  "presets": [{"name":"Giving back"}],
  "tag": null,
  "class": "giving-back-block"
}
{% endschema %}